  "location": "MAR33.42 vs MAR32.9 Table 1",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: MAR33.42 vs MAR32.9 Table 1",
      "summary": "The MAR32.9 Table 1 header cites MAR33.44 for the qualitative add-on, but that add-on is set in MAR33.42; MAR33.44 covers quarterly updates.",
      "impact": "Position: Amber zone, 7 exceptions, supervisor qualitative add-on 0.10 Reading a: 1.5 + 0.33 (plus) + 0.10 = 1.93 Reading b: Table value 1.83 + 0.10 = 1.93; or table value as plus alone 1.5+1.83 = 3.33 Difference: backtesting multiplier 1.93 vs 3.33 at worst",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
